        'context_policy':'Same static KDD prefix and repository per case. Parent assembled context/guardrails for evidence outside candidate copies; no task-specific retrieved text or target files injected.',
        'quality_policy':'Parent-owned holdouts and original sealed focused suites; all protected tracked files unchanged; production-only edits; plain git diff --check; real task exit/usage and treatment. This is not full Level 1/CI certification.',
